      "cooked": "<p>This came up on the BGG forums, and I realised I wasn't sure of the answer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Visionary uses her one shot to look at the top 3 cards of the villain deck.</p><p>1. If one of those three cards is a trap, does it go off?</p><p>2. If the fourth card (now visible on top of the deck while Visionary makes a decision) is a trap, does it go off, even though Visionary will be putting a card back on top of it?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:23.806Z",
